cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FVM_structured: finite-volume differential operators on 2D structured curvilinear grids"
abstract: >-
  Python/NumPy implementation of gradient, divergence, curl and Laplacian
  operators on 2D structured curvilinear grids using the finite volume method,
  with an automated verification suite against exact analytical solutions.
authors:
  - family-names: Shishkina
    given-names: Irina
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ishishkina/FVM_structured"
keywords:
  - finite volume method
  - curvilinear grids
  - Green-Gauss gradient
  - verification
  - Python
